Finally, your emphasis on research and development for clean technologies resonates with us. India proposes that we could collaboratively work on a structured blueprint for technology transfer, helping developing countries leapfrog to a sustainable future.

In conclusion, any solution must balance environmental imperatives with developmental necessities and historical responsibilities. India eagerly looks forward to continued dialogue and potential collaboration towards this end.

Thank you.



